! Rigid TIP4P on NEWTIP for (H2O)4, h2h_gmin_tip4p.data plus a container.
! With RADIUS unset, io1.f90 gives NTIP the Lennard-Jones default,
! 3.4856 A here. takestep.f90 moves a molecular centre beyond the radius
! across the origin by one diameter.
! RADIUS is the largest oxygen distance from the oxygen centroid of the
! Wales-Hodges minimum (-116.5904186160 kJ/mol), 1.9229 A, plus 3 A.
! Every size uses that rule; scripts/tip4p_h2h/gm_radius.py prints it.
! The centres of mass of that minimum reach 1.9257 A.
! STEPS is long so H2H_BUDGET is the stop. The driver appends RANSEED.
! CENTRE and SORT are omitted: they reorder a centre/angle-axis block.

NTIP 4
SLOPPYCONV 1.0D-3
TIGHTCONV 1.0D-4
EDIFF 0.01
MAXIT 800 500
SAVE 2
RADIUS 4.9229

TEMPERATURE 2.0
FIXTEMP
STEPS 90000000 1.0
STEP 0.40 0.51
FIXSTEP
